{"title":"2025 CJMC Problems/Problem A2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CJMC_Problems/Problem_A2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Manaswi wants to watch a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/4/4f4b8590f8aa9f9894b3891dd5dede0e354fa04e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minute video but she has to leave for school in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes. What's the slowest playback speed listed below that will let her finish the video before she has to leave.\n</p><p>(A) 1.25x\n(B) 1.5x\n(C) 1.75x\n(D) 2x\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CJMC_Problems/Problem_A2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> be the playback speed needed at minimum. We then have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/5/d356e98bb0b9e9f60b79bd3e93433e86f9dbc81f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20s \\geq 32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"71\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/3/ba34f982355c25b4d7e8293736b4838543c9585b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s \\geq \\frac{32}{20} = 1.6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"104\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Of the answer choices, the lowest number above this would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/1/611041aab07a8f987fb0c34737255704e4f7adfc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(C) } 1.75x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"91\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CJMC_Problems/Problem_A2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can realise that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/7/15788e198a53ced87268aea78fcde68a84de92c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/d/b7d3560fba12b97d35543b1e1028c14f5f1545b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.25$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"31\" height=\"13\" /> don't work because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/f/2dfb2809dbc484c3b48b599effa23eac6d957031.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.5 \\times 20 = 30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"108\" height=\"15\" />, which is less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/4/4f4b8590f8aa9f9894b3891dd5dede0e354fa04e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. Next, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/a/29ad276aacc4ae390c398784822e4ecf5e8aa62d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.75 \\times 20 = \\frac{7}{4} \\times 20 = 35$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"195\" height=\"38\" />. This is above <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/4/4f4b8590f8aa9f9894b3891dd5dede0e354fa04e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/1/611041aab07a8f987fb0c34737255704e4f7adfc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(C) } 1.75x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"91\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CJMC_Problems/Problem_A2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CJMC_Problems/Problem_A1\" title=\"2025 CJMC Problems/Problem A1\">Problem A1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CJMC_Problems/Problem_A3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CJMC Problems/Problem A3 (page does not exist)\">Problem A3</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: